{"title": "Unstoppable (Condition)", "pageid": 19004, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Unstoppable</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Reduce the next damage taken by the entity to 1 and consumes one charge of Unstoppable. Unstoppable creatures cannot be moved by any external forces — mundane or magical. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEATHSHEAD_UNSTOPPABLE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDEATHSHEAD_UNSTOPPABLE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDEATHSHEAD_UNSTOPPABLE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>For weapon attacks, most sources of additional damage do not consume additional charges of Unstoppable, even when appearing separately in the combat log.</li>\n<li>Some effects can consume one charge of Unstoppable <i>in addition</i> to the attack or spell that caused said effects. The list is non-exhaustive.\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_of_Combustion\" title=\"Oil of Combustion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/COAT_Oil_of_Combustion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oil_of_Combustion\" title=\"Oil of Combustion\">Oil of Combustion</a> (when ignited)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/25px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/38px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/50px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cull the Weak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/25px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\">Cull the Weak</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" title=\"Sneak Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sneak Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Every <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> projectile counts as a separate attack and therefore takes one charge of Unstoppable for each projectile. Upcasting Magic Missile can effectively remove all charges of Unstoppable from an enemy in one turn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Unstoppable\">Sources of Unstoppable</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Hungry\" title=\"Murder Hungry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murder Hungry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Hungry\" title=\"Murder Hungry\">Murder Hungry</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_the_Unstoppable\" title=\"Boon of the Unstoppable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boon of the Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_the_Unstoppable\" title=\"Boon of the Unstoppable\">Boon of the Unstoppable</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Unstoppable\">Creatures with Unstoppable</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condit